{"4524600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kint", "steam_appid": 4524600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/9d13f09dd6420e91be0ccd9138524516.avif?t=1780514552\" width=577 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to KINT! An online multiplayer RPG that's <strong><i>completely</i></strong> text-based. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where <strong><i>players</i></strong> discover lore and must vote together for it to be marked as the truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens if you find multiple things that conflict? Then the players will have to resolve it - majority wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/f988db1a09664b3c2095e6025d250fc4.poster.avif?t=1780514552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/f988db1a09664b3c2095e6025d250fc4.webm?t=1780514552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/f988db1a09664b3c2095e6025d250fc4.mp4?t=1780514552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Seram.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Almost 100 years ago, the Kilns arrived, and with that, life as we knew it had changed forever.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to venture into the different lands and research everything that you can: how the people live, the nature that exists, why the Kilns arrived and what the gifted Ferrus can actually do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/92b7b252b822736ab0feffc3fd8aea00.poster.avif?t=1780514552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/92b7b252b822736ab0feffc3fd8aea00.webm?t=1780514552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/92b7b252b822736ab0feffc3fd8aea00.mp4?t=1780514552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By interacting with Objects and People across each region, you will discover lore fragments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are  <strong>key</strong> in KINT. By building up your codex, you will help us map out the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The decided truth is marked as Canonized for all players to see, no matter what land they're currently in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROPOSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/cfa0fed5561521be5c6494792faebad5.poster.avif?t=1780514552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/cfa0fed5561521be5c6494792faebad5.webm?t=1780514552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/cfa0fed5561521be5c6494792faebad5.mp4?t=1780514552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each week, you'll be able to make one proposal for Canonization. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These proposals contain lore fragments about a single codex topic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can add multiple fragments to a proposal, but it'll cost <strong><i>Insight.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/62e89d0cde09b077a4b81ce4c9987438.poster.avif?t=1780514552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/62e89d0cde09b077a4b81ce4c9987438.webm?t=1780514552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/62e89d0cde09b077a4b81ce4c9987438.mp4?t=1780514552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also add information to other players' proposals and even vote on topics, so they may be chosen for Canonisation each weekend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONFLICT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before fragments are Canonized (the truth for all players), they will have to be reviewed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Saturday (Selldae) you will see a group of fragments that conflict and choose one you hold as the truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearsay and stories told over time may cause a lot of inconsistencies, so it's up to the entire playerbase to address them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CANON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/55680271e8e559e1cb30a81fdc8a76b0.poster.avif?t=1780514552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/55680271e8e559e1cb30a81fdc8a76b0.webm?t=1780514552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/55680271e8e559e1cb30a81fdc8a76b0.mp4?t=1780514552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the last day of each week, the players will see what fragments are Canonized by the highest vote, and these are marked in the Codex as the truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From these, XP is earned toward your researcher rank based on your contributions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOCIAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/95648b3575c69bd0f95072ad238357bb.poster.avif?t=1780514552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/95648b3575c69bd0f95072ad238357bb.webm?t=1780514552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/95648b3575c69bd0f95072ad238357bb.mp4?t=1780514552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friends list from Steam will be available, and you can add friends in-game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, you can send a Lore Fragment to a friend via the mailbox, no matter which land they are in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's also a chat for the current region you're in, so you can tell other players if something is happening in the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACCESSIBILITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/4f0bd7ec544f1ac75132269279c06fac.poster.avif?t=1780514552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/4f0bd7ec544f1ac75132269279c06fac.webm?t=1780514552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/4f0bd7ec544f1ac75132269279c06fac.mp4?t=1780514552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kint has multiple accessibility settings, with more being added throughout development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including support for Open dyslexia- a font to improve the readability of text for those with Dyslexia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIVING WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KINT is truly a live online game without needing update cycles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe an NPC you talked to yesterday is no longer there, maybe there's an event happening in a town you're heading to. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other MMOs, places you started in or have travelled away from might still be important to visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4524600/extras/9d13f09dd6420e91be0ccd9138524516.avif?t=1780514552\" width=577 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to KINT! An online multiplayer RPG that's <strong><i>completely</i></strong> text-based. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where <strong><i>players</i></strong> discover lore and must vote together for it to be marked as the truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens if you find multiple things that conflict? Then the players will have to resolve it - majority wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea